e TinyBERT's performance."], 'source_chunk_index': [4]}, 'Transformer distillation': {'description': ['A novel distillation method specifically designed for Transformer-based models, used to transfer knowledge from BERT to TinyBERT.', 'A novel method proposed for knowledge distillation of Transformer-based models, specifically designed to transfer knowledge from a large teacher BERT to a smaller student TinyBERT. It involves designing several loss functions to fit different representations from BERT layers.', 'A specially designed KD method for Transformer-based models, focusing on distilling knowledge from BERT layers.', 'A specific method of knowledge distillation applied to Transformer-based models, focusing on transferring knowledge from various layers of the teacher model (BERT) to the student model (TinyBERT).', 'A specific method of knowledge distillation focused on transferring knowledge from the layers of a Transformer-based model, such as BERT.', 'A method used in TinyBERT to transfer knowledge from BERT layers, including embedding, hidden states, attention matrices, and prediction layer outputs.', 'A key component of the TinyBERT learning process, as indicated by the significant performance drop when it is removed (No Trm).'], 'type': ['method', 'METHOD'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, 'Data augmentation': {'description': ["The process of creating additional training data, used in the task-specific distillation stage to improve TinyBERT's performance.", 'The process of creating more task-related materials to provide more task-related materials for teacher-student learning during the task-specific distillation stage.', 'A method used to increase the size and diversity of the training data, specifically by using word-level replacement with GloVe embeddings to improve the performance of TinyBERT.', 'A technique used in the task-specific distillation stage to improve performance.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0, 2, 3]}, 'Loss functions': {'description': ['The specific functions designed to fit different representations from BERT layers during Transformer distillation. These include functions for the embedding layer output, hidden states and attention matrices from the Transformer layer, and logits from the prediction layer.', 'Several loss functions are designed to fit different representations from BERT layers during Transformer distillation.', 'Several loss functions designed to fit different representations from BERT layers, including the output of the embedding layer, hidden states and attention matrices from the Transformer layer, and the logits output by the prediction layer.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'General domain corpus': {'description': ["The large-scale unsupervised text corpus used for pre-training BERT and subsequently used by TinyBERT to mimic the teacher's behavior through Transformer distillation."], 'type': ['dataset'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Prediction-layer distillation': {'description': ['A distillation technique that focuses on transferring knowledge from the prediction layer of the teacher model to the student model.', 'A component of the TinyBERT learning process, specifically focused on distilling knowledge from the prediction layer.', 'A method used in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework.'], 'type': ['method', 'METHOD'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 3]}, 'Task-specific distillation': {'description': ['A stage in the two-stage learning framework where TinyBERT is fine-tuned on a task-specific dataset, using a teacher model (fine-tuned BERT) and data augmentation to improve performance on specific NLP tasks.', 'A fine-tuning stage where TinyBERT continues learning task-specific knowledge from the fine-tuned teacher BERT model.', 'A fine-tuning stage in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework, performed on augmented datasets.'], 'type': ['method', 'METHOD'], 'source_chunk_index': [2, 3, 4]}, 'General Distillation (GD)': {'description': ['The pre-training stage of the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework.', 'A pre-training stage where TinyBERT learns knowledge from intermediate layers of the teacher BERT model.', 'A pre-training stage in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework, using English Wikipedia as the text corpus.'], 'type': ['method', 'METHOD'], 'source_chunk_index': [3, 4]}, 'Task-specific Distillation (TD)': {'description': ['The fine-tuning stage of the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework.', 'A fine-tuning stage in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework, performed on augmented datasets.'], 'type': ['method', 'METHOD'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Data Augmentation (DA)': {'description': ['A technique used to increase the size and diversity of the training data, particularly in the task-specific distillation phase.', 'A technique used in the task-specific distillation stage to improve performance.'], 'type': ['method', 'METHOD'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}, 'Intermediate layer distillation': {'description': ['A method used in the two-stage TinyBERT learning framework.', 'A key procedure in the TinyBERT learning framework, used during both general and task-specific distillation.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}}
